WEBVTT

00:03:28.454 --> 00:03:31.874
The first and only in Afghanistan.

00:03:32.792 --> 00:03:38.464
(Applause)

00:03:38.506 --> 00:03:43.010
That year, we enrolled
24 girls in sixth grade.

00:03:44.262 --> 00:03:45.888
By 2021,

00:03:45.888 --> 00:03:49.350
we had enrolled nearly 100 girls
in grades six to 11.

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:53.187
I'll tell you something I'm very proud of.

00:03:53.688 --> 00:03:55.481
In 2016,

00:03:55.481 --> 00:03:59.735
we drew girls from 14
of Afghanistan's 34 provinces.